{#-
  The AEM version drop-down for one doc-class (contract supplied 2026-09-10). It
  sits beside the version folders, not above the doc-classes, so `path` is the
  bare dashed segment: the doc-class level would be wrong, not just redundant.

  `rows` arrives fully ordered and fully merged from `sync/versions.py` -- the
  catalog-derived rows in numeric-descending order, any hand-written rows already
  back in their original positions around them. Nothing is sorted or filtered
  here. A template that decided either would be a second place the drop-down's
  contents are chosen, and it would be the place nobody tests.
-#}
# AEM version drop-down
# Generated by DocuShift (Stage 6). Rows pointing outside this doc-class are left
# as they were found -- hand-written entries survive a re-sync.
versions:
{% for row in rows -%}
- title: {{ row.title | yaml }}
  path: {{ row.path | yaml }}
{% endfor -%}
